# Generated artifacts. These are produced byte-for-byte by their generator
# and verified against it (packages/contracts/scripts/verify-generated.mjs
# diffs the committed file against a fresh regeneration, per P1-02) — so
# Prettier must not rewrite them, or `pnpm build` and `pnpm format` end up
# demanding two different files and CI can never be green with both.
packages/contracts/src/generated/

# Written by pnpm, read by pnpm. Reformatting it gains nothing and risks a
# `--frozen-lockfile` mismatch in CI for a purely cosmetic reason.
pnpm-lock.yaml

